    {
      "id": "claim_cd1f1aaade04499396bb4695dc2bcd00",
      "statement": "The module indexes are export registries rather than automatic configuration: the NixOS index exports `php-config`, while the Home Manager index exports `ngrok` and `php-config`; consumers must explicitly import the exported attributes.",
