      "statement": "`modules/shared/php-config.nix` provides a typed PHP configuration interface to both module systems and computes read-only `config.phpConfig._lib` helpers from `pkgs/php-lib.nix`, allowing NixOS and Home Manager to consume common PHP policy while retaining separate consumers.",
