    {
      "id": "claim_d1508f59a7fa41b0999287f12550f740",
      "statement": "The local PHP development stack crosses ownership layers: Home Manager provisions PHP site files and directory traversal permissions, while NixOS owns Nginx virtual hosts, PHP-FPM pools, sockets, and service access to the user's site tree.",
